      "content": "it just feels so much more logical than fighting it. like, if the house is already empty and the lights are failing anyway, why keep trying to fix something that's clearly dead? there's a weird kind of comfort in just accepting that it's over. like, if i just stopped trying to hold on, wouldn't the darkness be quieter? wouldn't it just be... easier?",
